# Builder Agents Guide

## Commit Message Format

- Subject: `<TICKET>: add <package_name>`
- Body: explain placement and build strategy
- Trailer for combined onboarding: `Relates-to: <TICKET>` (pipeline commit closes)

## Package Placement Rules

Follow [Collection Integration](onboarding/04-collection-integration.md).
Select universal, torchless, or the mapped Torch collection from build needs;
never default every package to a Torch collection. Prefer source-based building.

## Linting

Run `make regen` and `make linter-sandbox` before committing, then
`make linter-mr` after committing. Fix all errors.
